OL,3,GNEWSAMass train stabbing over in five
OL,4,Aminutes, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mass train stabbing in which a
OL,7,Fknifeman is accused of trying to kill
OL,8,F10 people in a "storm of violence" was
OL,9,F"all over in about five minutes", a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams, 33, denies 14 counts
OL,13,Fof attempted murder in relation to an
OL,14,Fattack on a London-bound LNER train
OL,15,Fbetween Peterborough and Huntingdon on
OL,16,F1 November 2025, and incidents in
OL,17,FPeterborough and London the day before.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
