OL,3,GNEWSAMass train stabbing over in five
OL,4,Aminutes, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the second day of the trial at
OL,7,FCambridge Crown Court, prosecutor
OL,8,FChristopher Paxton KC described CCTV
OL,9,Ffootage showing "hand to hand fighting"
OL,10,Fand a victim "literally fighting for
OL,11,Fhis life."
OL,13,FJurors also heard how a victim thought
OL,14,Fhe would die, but was saved by his dog
OL,15,Fwho "sent the defendant running off".
